# Line endings are LF in the repository and in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout converts to CRLF and Prettier - which is configured for LF -
# fails on the whole tree after any rebase, pull or branch switch, while the committed content is
# perfectly fine. Fixtures are hash-pinned by byte, so a working copy that differs from what CI
# checks out is worth avoiding for that reason too.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, and hash-pinned by `scripts/verify-fixtures.py`: never converted.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
